      "writtenOn": "2021-12-10T12:16:17Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "The fundamental reasoning here is that if a task is not preempted, i.e. doesn\u0027t use up its entire sched_slice(), it gets its throughput demand met. It should therefore be safe to _not_ lift the effective max-clamp.",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 37,
        "startChar": 15,
        "endLine": 39,
        "endChar": 27
      },
      "revId": "e59064cc8bdb0b3f848773efe8a1ab2ae102edde",
