      "message": "Hmm I was a bit overzealous here mainly to cater for changes in uclamp settings of the task since wake up.\n\nI agree this check could cause more harm than help. I\u0027ll remove it and update the patch in case this causes interference when verifying/testing the approach.\n\nXuewen, we are after a feedback whether this filter helps in increasing the effectiveness of uclamp_max since max aggregation could lead to lifting the cap when these small tasks run. If you encountered the issue, your feedback on whether this solution helps you to fix this problem would be much appreciated 😊",
